classes), have just lost some hp bringing you to less than 10% of your
maximum, and have exactly 1 hp left. If you have more than 1, you hear
"the howling of the CwnAnnwn".

The Gauntlet characters get different messages depending on their
intrinsics. Not all hp losses lead to a wailing.

